The research graph in this directory (assistant/) is adapted from
"Ollama Deep Researcher" (now "Local Deep Researcher") by Lance Martin / LangChain,
https://github.com/langchain-ai/local-deep-researcher, released under the MIT License.

Changes for EthicalAI: wrapped in a FastAPI service, defaulted to Gemma 4 12B,
removed the Perplexity backend and LangSmith tracing, replaced print statements
with logging, made per-request settings override environment defaults, and fixed
the loop counter so the configured number of searches runs exactly.

